{"id": "q_e5e5818472dc", "type": "percent", "answer": -82.86, "_code": "\nimport pandas as pd\no=don_hang.drop_duplicates('MaHoaDon').copy()\no['dt']=pd.to_datetime(o['ThoiGianLap']).dt.normalize()\no=o[~o.TinhTrang.isin(['cancelled','returned'])]\nc=chi_tiet_don.drop_duplicates()\nc=c[c.MaHoaDon.isin(o.MaHoaDon)].merge(o[['MaHoaDon','dt']],on='MaHoaDon')\n\nx=c[c.MaHangHoa=='SP0028']\nD=pd.Timestamp('2025-09-24')\na=x[(x.dt>=D)&(x.dt<=D+pd.Timedelta(days=13))].SLQuyDoi.astype(float).sum()\nb=x[(x.dt>=D-pd.Timedelta(days=14))&(x.dt<=D-pd.Timedelta(days=1))].SLQuyDoi.astype(float).sum()\nRESULT=f\"{round((a-b)/b*100,2):.2f}%\"", "_attempts": 1, "_verdict": "correct"}
