{"id": "q_a634c6db12d4", "type": "number", "answer": 428550, "_code": "\no=don_hang[don_hang.TinhTrang!='cancelled'].copy()\no=o[o.PhuongThucTT!='cod']\no=o[o.KenhBanHang.isin(['store','phone'])|True]\no['dt']=pd.to_datetime(o.ThoiGianLap)\no=o[o.dt<'2025-11-27']\np=thanh_toan.copy(); p['t']=pd.to_datetime(p.NgayGioThu); p=p[p.t<'2025-12-05']\npaid=p.groupby('MaHoaDon').SoTienThu.sum()\no['paid']=o.MaHoaDon.map(paid).fillna(0)\no['rem']=pd.to_numeric(o.TongThanhToan)-o.paid\nRESULT=int(o[o.rem>0].rem.sum())\n", "_attempts": 1, "_verdict": "correct"}
